{"id":"n69579-4-6","stage":1,"title":"살다 · 生动呈现","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69579-4-6-1","ko":"화가의 그림은 참 개성적입니다.","zh":"画家的画作真有个性。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화가의","meaning":"画家","explanation":"화가：画家；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"화가","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73228","senseId":"1","lemma":"화가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화가의","audio":"/audio/e7ca6c91a1db1b4cac80.mp3"}},{"text":"그림은","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림은","audio":"/audio/1d6abc0ee806f397935d.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"개성적입니다.","meaning":"有个性的，独特的","explanation":"개성적：有个性的，独特的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"개성적","audio":"/audio/9f08d5422c2addc1552d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26570","senseId":"1","lemma":"개성적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개성적입니다","audio":"/audio/a57edfdc19fa5e5f4f75.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b04487b70213c84b","term":"화가","zh":"画家","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3","entryId":"73228","definition":"专业画画的人。","pronunciation":["화ː가"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"9f08d5422c2addc1","term":"개성적","zh":"有个性的，独特的","audio":"/audio/9f08d5422c2addc1552d.mp3","entryId":"26570","definition":"区别于其他的，具有固有特性的。","pronunciation":["개ː성적"]}],"audio":"/audio/8034d91c94ebd01a5ef7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69579-4-6-2","ko":"네. 그의 개성이 고스란히 살아 있습니다.","zh":"是的，他的个性在画中鲜明地体现了出来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是的","explanation":"네 在这里肯定前一句关于画作的评价；不是回应别人呼唤。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그의","meaning":"他的","explanation":"그의 是 그 加所有格 -의，指前文那位画家的。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그의","audio":"/audio/badf585583116fd1900a.mp3"}},{"text":"개성이","meaning":"个性","explanation":"개성：个性；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"개성","audio":"/audio/3ffc14995483915c205e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15788","senseId":"1","lemma":"개성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개성이","audio":"/audio/6eebc918ffe23d190c0c.mp3"}},{"text":"고스란히","meaning":"原封不动地，完整地","explanation":"고스란히：原封不动地，完整地。","readings":[{"term":"고스란히","audio":"/audio/846925c642a6b8bdc9dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18006","senseId":"1","lemma":"고스란히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고스란히","audio":"/audio/846925c642a6b8bdc9dc.mp3"}},{"text":"살아","meaning":"鲜明地体现","explanation":"고스란히 살아 있다 表示原有个性清楚、完整地体现在画作中。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"4","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아","audio":"/audio/30d811da4a1eb958a364.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanatio